      "id": "rdls_exp-fji_pacificdata_populationgrid2020",
      "title": "Fiji Population Grid 2020",
      "description": "Data Input: Settlement footprint generated by combining 2007 household listing locations and Facebook's High-Resolution Population Density Maps. Population allocated proportionally using 2017 census population counts at enumeration area level. Year Population Growth Rate of 0.38% has been applied to update population up to 2020 The human settlement footprint with population allocated has been converted into a 100 m resolution raster. 2020 5 years old derived from simple average annual growth rate applied for the three year period at Tikina level, with simplifying assumption that national rates apply evenly (without other input data, it is seen as appropriate for this exercise) [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal pacificdata]",
